    {
      "index": 2,
      "he": "א.\r\n\r\n עִיר שֶׁיֵּשׁ בָּהּ קַבָּלַת שׁחַד, חֲיָלוֹת בָּאִין עָלֶיהָ.",
      "en": "A city in which bribes are accepted, armies come upon it."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "he": "ב.\r\n\r\n עַל-יְדֵי שׁחַד גְּדֻלָּתוֹ מִסְתַּלֶּקֶת.",
      "en": "Through bribery, one's greatness departs."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "he": "ג.\r\n\r\n עַל-יְדֵי שׁחַד בָּא שְׂרֵפָה.",
      "en": "1. Through drunkenness, one falls from his level.\n\nThrough bribery come fires."
    }
